  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e20ce9f6737e6e845b50655fcc50fb57, type: 3}
  m_Name: Guardian2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: Hand of Torvalds
  lines:
  - You have learned to find what you seek.
  - But open source is about more than finding code.
  - It is about sharing it.
  - When many people are free to build upon the same code, mistakes are bound to
    happen.
  - But mistakes don't have to be permanent.
  - Mistakes may be reversed.
  - Defeat me, and I shall teach you the spell.
